# T4.8a: two rooms, the east one's floor 24 up under a ceiling at 80
# (RouteTestMaps): 56 units, the player steps up into it: run east into the
# east wall, slide along it, turn north-east, run strafing left, walk
# diagonally, back off (a 24-unit fall).
iwad testmap
map raised80
# forwardmove sidemove turn buttons [xcount]; turn << 8 = angleturn
50 0 0 0 x30
0 0 0 0 x8
50 30 0 0 x30
0 0 4 0 x8
50 -20 0 0 x30
25 25 0 0 x20
-50 0 0 0 x20
0 0 0 0 x10
